{"articleNo":"86119","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=86119&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[창업교육센터]국내외 경진대회 및 공모전 참가 경비 지원","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.07.01","hit":"3649","attachments":[{"name":"국내외 경진대회 참가지원 결과보고서(학생제출용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=86119&attachNo=71565"},{"name":"국내외 경진대회 참가지원 신청서(학생제출용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=86119&attachNo=71616"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">창업교육센터에서는 산학협력선도대학</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(LINC)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">육성사업의 일환으로 개인 및 창업동아리 학생들의 대외경진대회 참가에 경비를&nbsp;지원하고 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;국내외에서 개최하는 창업 경진대회나 공모전에 우수 아이디어 및 작품 출품을 통해 창의력과 창업소양기술을 갖춘 우수한 창업인재를 양성하고자&nbsp;이와 같은&nbsp;사업을 지원하고 있으니 많은 신청바랍니다</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원분야 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국내외에서 개최하는 창업경진대회나 공모전 경비지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경진대회는 지방규모 이상이어야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원내용 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">등록비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">식비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">숙박비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원이내에서 실비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">),</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 교통비</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대중교통수단만 지급가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-KTX</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일반실 기준</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">구미김천역기준</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">))</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">최대 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">200</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원 이내에서 지원 가능(국내일 경우)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-국외 경진대회일 경우는 협의를 통해 지원금액 조정 가능.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-지원내용은 경진대회 특성상 조정될 수도 있음.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 말까지 참가한 경진대회에 한해 예산 소신시까지 선착순 지급 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청방법 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경진대회 참가하기 전 본 센터에 참가신청서(첨부파일 참고)를 작성해서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대회 모집요강</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">포스터, 참가자명단&nbsp;등이 포함된&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;대회 소개나 일정 관련 자료 함께 제출</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경진대회 참가 이후 참가결과보고서와 증빙자료를 함께 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경진대회 참가 후 제출서류 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;가</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">결과보고서(첨부파일 참고)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;나</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">증빙서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교통비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">열차</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고속버스승차권영수증</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">숙박영수증 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">간이영수증은 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">반드시 현금영수증 또는 카드 전표</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;다</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가확인서 및 대회 모집요강</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">포스터</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">소개 일정 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;라</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가 후 수상 실적이 있을 경우 상장</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사본</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이나 상패</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사진</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수상실적이 있으면 바로 연락 주세요</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">보도자료 배포할 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;마</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원받고자 하는 개인의 통장사본</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타 문의사항 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업교육센터</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이오스관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">313</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-wi